      "event_at": "2026-01-08T09:20:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-01-08T11:00:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nCreatinine 1.18 mg/dL; eGFR 58 mL/min/1.73 m2; potassium 4.6 mmol/L; sodium 139 mmol/L; BUN 20 mg/dL. Results are final.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-02.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Primary Care",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-03",
      "patient_id": "SYN-002",
      "encounter_id": "ENC-002-02",
      "document_type": "progress_note",
      "title": "Hypertension treatment review",
      "author": "Dr. Hana Tesfaye",
      "event_at": "2026-02-12T09:40:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-02-12T12:00:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nBlood pressure remains above goal. Patient reports using ibuprofen several days per week for knee pain. Lisinopril is discontinued in the prescribing plan and losartan 50 mg daily is ordered. Repeat renal panel in four weeks.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-03.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Primary Care",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-04",
      "patient_id": "SYN-002",
      "encounter_id": "ENC-002-02",
      "document_type": "medication_reconciliation",
      "title": "Medication reconciliation at treatment review",
      "author": "Nurse R. Ali",
      "event_at": "2026-02-12T09:15:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-02-12T11:30:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nPatient-reported home medicines: lisinopril 20 mg each morning, amlodipine 5 mg nightly. Patient says a new replacement medicine was discussed but has not yet started it. Lisinopril marked to stop in the plan.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-04.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Primary Care",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-05",
      "patient_id": "SYN-002",
      "encounter_id": "ENC-002-02",
      "document_type": "prescription",
      "title": "Losartan prescription",
