      "authored_at": "2026-02-12T09:46:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nLisinopril 20 mg tablet is discontinued in the electronic order list on 2026-02-12. The order status does not establish when the patient stopped taking previously supplied tablets.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-06.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Primary Care",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-07",
      "patient_id": "SYN-002",
      "encounter_id": "ENC-002-03",
      "document_type": "emergency_note",
      "title": "Emergency visit for gastroenteritis",
      "author": "Dr. Samuel Kassa",
      "event_at": "2026-03-03T20:10:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-03-03T23:00:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nTwo days of poor intake and watery diarrhea. Received IV fluids. Patient states she takes lisinopril for blood pressure but is unsure of the replacement name. Avoid NSAIDs during illness. Discharge medication list imported from an outside pharmacy includes lisinopril 20 mg daily and amlodipine 5 mg nightly.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-07.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Emergency Medicine",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-08",
      "patient_id": "SYN-002",
      "encounter_id": "ENC-002-03",
      "document_type": "medication_reconciliation",
      "title": "Emergency medication reconciliation",
      "author": "Nurse T. Bekele",
      "event_at": "2026-03-03T19:00:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-03-03T22:20:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nExternal medication list reviewed: lisinopril 20 mg daily marked active; losartan not visible. Patient is unable to confirm the last dose. This is a reconciliation source, not proof of administration.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-08.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Emergency Medicine",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-09",
      "patient_id": "SYN-002",
      "encounter_id": "ENC-002-03",
      "document_type": "discharge_summary",
      "title": "Emergency discharge summary",
      "author": "Dr. Samuel Kassa",
      "event_at": "2026-03-03T22:45:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-03-04T08:00:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nDischarged after fluids with improved symptoms. Follow up with primary care for renal panel and medication reconciliation. The imported list may be outdated.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-09.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Emergency Medicine",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-10",
