      "authored_at": "2026-03-10T10:00:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nCreatinine 1.55 mg/dL; eGFR 41 mL/min/1.73 m2; potassium 5.2 mmol/L; sodium 137 mmol/L; BUN 31 mg/dL. Results are final.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-10.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Clinical Laboratory",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-11",
      "patient_id": "SYN-002",
      "encounter_id": "ENC-002-05",
      "document_type": "progress_note",
      "title": "Primary care reassessment after illness",
      "author": "Dr. Hana Tesfaye",
      "event_at": "2026-03-18T14:35:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-03-18T17:00:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nRenal function is worse than baseline after a diarrheal illness. Patient brought an old bottle labeled lisinopril 20 mg and says she may have taken it until the emergency visit; she cannot state how often. Losartan is listed in the clinic plan, but actual start date is uncertain. Hold NSAIDs and repeat labs.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-11.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Primary Care",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-12",
      "patient_id": "SYN-002",
      "encounter_id": "ENC-002-05",
      "document_type": "medication_reconciliation",
      "title": "Clinic medication reconciliation",
      "author": "Nurse R. Ali",
      "event_at": "2026-03-18T14:10:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-03-18T16:30:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nPatient-reported: amlodipine daily; lisinopril bottle present, use uncertain; losartan prescription present in chart, patient reports not recognizing the name. Reconciliation remains unresolved.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-12.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Primary Care",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-002-13",
