      "document_type": "progress_note",
      "title": "Primary care follow-up",
      "author": "Dr. Hana Tesfaye",
      "event_at": "2026-05-14T09:55:00+03:00",
      "authored_at": "2026-05-14T12:00:00+03:00",
      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nPatient has avoided ibuprofen and reports improved hydration. She now uses a pill organizer but still cannot confirm whether the old lisinopril tablets were taken after the February visit. Current plan lists losartan and amlodipine. Repeat labs are stable.",
      "storage_path": "cases/CASE-002/documents/DOC-002-17.pdf",
      "metadata": {
        "department": "Primary Care",
        "synthetic_label": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
