      "mime_type": "application/pdf",
      "text_content": "SYNTHETIC - NOT FOR CLINICAL USE\nBring all medication containers to the next visit. Do not use non-prescribed NSAIDs while renal function is being monitored. This instruction is synthetic and does not constitute treatment advice.",
